data: {"id":"gen-1794255983-q6SueuEEwyZi6dtClePy","object":"chat.completion.chunk","created":1794255983,"model":"google/gemini-2.5-flash","provider":"Google AI Studio","choices":[{"index":0,"delta":{"content":"","role":"assistant","reasoning":"**Evaluating Iteration Progress**\n\nI'm now diving into the agent's iterative approach. After initial, relevant searches focusing on Frontier Restaurant and JBA winners, it refined by adding \"book\" to the query, which was a good step. However, I observed that these did not yield the desired results. Next, the agent cleverly pivoted to identify JBA winners associated with New Mexican cuisine, correctly identifying Cheryl Jamison as a promising cookbook author. The final step combined the author's name with the restaurant for a highly specific search. This indicates a solid iterative strategy.\n\n\n","reasoning_details":[{"type":"reasoning.text","text":"**Evaluating Iteration Progress**\n\nI'm now diving into the agent's iterative approach. After initial, relevant searches focusing on Frontier Restaurant and JBA winners, it refined by adding \"book\" to the query, which was a good step. However, I observed that these did not yield the desired results. Next, the agent cleverly pivoted to identify JBA winners associated with New Mexican cuisine, correctly identifying Cheryl Jamison as a promising cookbook author. The final step combined the author's name with the restaurant for a highly specific search. This indicates a solid iterative strategy.\n\n\n","format":"google-gemini-v1","index":0}]},"finish_reason":null,"native_finish_reason":null}]}

